  "description": "A fast, lightweight structured logging library for .NET using the logfmt format. Includes encoder, parser, Microsoft.Extensions.Logging provider, and OpenTelemetry exporter. ~110ns per log call, zero-alloc when filtered.",
  "id": "logfmt.net",
  "isPrerelease": false,
